OL,3,ATupac murder accused told police in
OL,4,A2008 his nephew fired fatal shots
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man accused of orchestrating the
OL,7,Fmurder of Tupac Shakur told police more
OL,8,Fthan a decade later that he handed the
OL,9,Fgun used in the drive-by shooting to a
OL,10,Fpassenger who then passed it to his
OL,11,Fnephew who opened fire on the rapper.
OL,13,FDuane "Keffe D" Davis is on trial in
OL,14,FLas Vegas, charged with one count of
OL,15,Fmurder with a deadly weapon over the
OL,16,Fkilling of the rap superstar in 1996.
OL,17,FOn Thursday jurors heard a recording of
OL,18,Fa police interview with Davis in 2008.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
